rce_completeness\": \"Deterministic source selection, not a proof of complete context. Ambiguous primary anchors retain full source; unresolved references require review.\", \"quantityEncoding\": {\"file\": \"schema/locked_representation_context.jsonld\", \"numeric_predicate\": \"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/numericValue\", \"unit_predicate\": \"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/unit\", \"canonical_literal_encoding\": \"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal\", \"quantity_class\": \"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue\", \"declarations\": {\"numericValue\": {\"@id\": \"qudt:numericValue\", \"@type\": \"xsd:decimal\"}, \"unit\": {\"@id\": \"qudt:unit\", \"@type\": \"@id\"}}, \"scope\": \"Declared quantity serialization, not a numeric-equality solution or conversion\"}, \"admission\": {\"declaration\": {\"format_version\": 2, \"admission_id\": \"SYNTHETIC_RESEARCH_SCOPE_20_I2_046_V1\", \"interpretation\": \"A\", \"population_description\": \"Synthetic design records supplied as the complete declared RDF-class population in each input. External legal/application eligibility and experimental edition selection are caller research assumptions, not inferred RDF facts or real-vessel certification. Records may be incomplete, inconsistent or contain unrecognized values. Conditions within the represented requirement, missing represented inputs, activation, datatype/unit/path and logical correctness remain for generated SHACL to assess. Evaluation covers finite represented inventories, not reconstruction of unrecorded real-world persons/components; this does not authorize inventing existence requirements or treating a represented missing value as compliant. Finite represented internal ice-strengthened structure inventories for synthetic Polar-Class design records. Polar-Class research eligibility and physical survey completeness are external assumptions for this proposed population, not inferred from a boolean or from missing assertions. Recorded corrosion/abrasion additions remain subject to the represented source requirement. No actual material measurement or real-vessel eligibility is certified.\", \"focus_set\": {\"mode\": \"COMPLETE_CLASS_POPULATION_PER_INPUT\", \"owner_class\": \"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#ship\"}, \"eligibility_assertion\": \"ASSUMED_EXTERNAL_RESEARCH_ELIGIBILITY\", \"provenance\": {\"declarant\": \"User\", \"reference\": \"Explicit user approval, 2026-11-25, of the sixteen exact declarations in APPROVAL_PROPOSAL.txt; see scope_approval.provenance.json in the preparation audit.\", \"basis\": \"Retained source, existing declared RDF representation and source-backed finite evaluation preparation; no model performance used.\"}, \"source_editions\": [{\"document_id\": \"UR I2\", \"edition\": \"Rev.4 (December 2019)\", \"file\": \"data/requirements/IACS_I2_full.txt\", \"sha256\": \"7ad8d57459782b70809da479380584a57cf259c66d9ff286811c0248b02732d2\", \"selection_provenance\": \"PROPOSED experimental edition selection from the retained catalog; not a legally governing-edition determination.\"}], \"approval\": {\"status\": \"APPROVED\", \"approved_by\": \"User\", \"reference\": \"Explicit user approval in Codex conversation, 2026-11-25; outputs/audits/20261125_TWENTY_REQUIREMENT_APPROVAL_PREPARATION/scope_approval.provenance.json\"}}, \"declaration_sha256\": \"b93e931aa6a1f7e1dd58626d729867bcaf13ea42ccfc1bd664fd0d2e6a3aa4fc\", \"scope_definition_sha256\": \"dbc646616df5133ebb44a1798b337329f21d29c670addc05c5a9769c8f987499\", \"policy\": {\"interpretation\": \"A\", \"external_responsibilities\": [\"synthetic research-population eligibility assumption\", \"applicable source-edition selection and construction-date eligibility\"], \"constraint_responsibilities\": [\"represented requirement obligations\", \"conditions within the represented requirement\", \"declared datatypes units and paths\", \"effective activation within admitted population\", \"complete query and logical correctness\"], \"no_eligibility_inferred_from_missin